            "meaning": "是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_6",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "He has just bought a new house in the city, but ever since he moved in, he has had trouble with cars and their owners.",
      "translation": "他刚在城里买了一座新房子，但自从搬进去后，他就开始与汽车及其车主发生了麻烦。",
      "startTime": 21.12,
      "endTime": 31.95,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "House",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "房子"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_7",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "When he returns home at night, he always finds that someone has parked a car outside his gate.",
      "translation": "当他晚上回家时，总是发现有人把汽车停在他家大门外。",
      "startTime": 31.96,
      "endTime": 40.55,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
